Okay, so here is what happened the last time I played NetHack. (3.0pl7
on ST)
I fought my way to hell and back again, equipped with _the_ amulet. 
Then I went to the endgame level. When attacking the monsters there
I was severely hurt (had only 1 hitpoint left) so 
I decided that it was about the time to pray. I did pray, and
dear Loki gave back my hitpoints, but he/she also told me that
to enter the castle I must play the right tune. I found it
very amusing that my god didn't know that I had already entered
the castle by playing the right tune.. 
So, would you please make the gods real - i.e. they should know what
the character has done. I hate to get instructions for something I've
already done.
 
PS. I _did_ complete the game that time. Whew, it took me almost a year.
 
